{"4155290": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Nomadoss Chronicles", "steam_appid": 4155290, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>About this game</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>In this light soul action-adventure game in early access (written by Chrys Gaman, author of the manga &quot;Les Chroniques des Nomadoss&quot;), you play as Cinq, a young warrior child of the orphan phenomenon, in search of his physical and spiritual identity. You complete missions for the villagers and defeat enemies until things don't go as smoothly as usual. Stunned, as a warrior, your skills are of no use when you learn that it is not through your own strength or power that you will overcome all your challenges, but that you actually need a higher power...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Set out to discover your true identity and find out what power you will need.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Note: <u><i><strong>This game is in Early Access, which means it is still in development.</strong></i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><i><strong>Some bugs may occur and updates are planned.</strong></i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAME FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face head-on the Kario cradles and other types of beasts already available in this early access version. Use your sword to protect your host village in the land of Harunha.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face groups of blue brigands and discover a mysterious force pulling the strings in the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For the first time in 3D, explore the land of Harunha. Meet its inhabitants and conduct investigations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loot and secrets</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open treasure chests to find valuable loot. Analyze the flora and fauna to gather important information.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rescue and progression</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rescue prisoners, escape, or defeat your enemies to get closer to your quest for identity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>With light, we chase away darkness; with the power of God, we chase away demons.</strong></i></p></p><br><h1>Face off against wild creatures</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4155290/extras/71284538dbb4483008f690abb3284179.avif?t=1769184252\" width=1560 height=878 /></span>Face off against wild creatures</p></p><br><h1>Land of Harunha</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4155290/extras/3fa1aa58ca8cdaf7a86cdf7a4ce5c6e7.avif?t=1769184252\" width=1560 height=878 /></span>Discover the magnificent landscape of Harunha, powered by the powerful Unreal Engine 5. </p></p><br><h1>Protect others</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4155290/extras/09dfac43adb36f156b211ca20009f658.avif?t=1769184252\" width=1560 height=878 /></span>Complete quests and help the villagers.</p></p><br><h1>Mysterious force</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4155290/extras/ac9cd439b53ae85d8076355409988d32.avif?t=1769184252\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are facing an opponent of a completely different kind.</p></p><br><h1>A vast universe</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4155290/extras/63fe60f50e79fee1b7e2901bf521f2fa.avif?t=1769184252\" width=616 height=405 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Land of Haruhna can also be discovered in manga form (only in French), with an English translation planned for 2026.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Faced with this entity from another world, the young warrior Cinq, the child of the phenomenon, finds himself forced to flee because his strength is no longer effective...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Back in his adopted village, questions swirl around in his head. Concerned for the safety</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>of the village and its residents, he tells the village elder about this grim encounter, asking him if there might be</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>another power greater than that of the children of the phenomenon? A power of light that could repel this entity of darkness?</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Faced with this entity from another world, the young warrior Cinq, the child of the phenomenon, finds himself forced to flee because his strength is no longer effective...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Back in his adopted village, questions swirl around in his head. Concerned for the safety</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>of the village and its residents, he tells the village elder about this grim encounter, asking him if there might be</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>another power greater than that of the children of the phenomenon? A power of light that could repel this entity of darkness?</i></p>", "short_description": "A Souls Light-style adventure game. Develop your character, defeat bosses, and hunt demons in this game set in the universe of the French manga, Les Chroniques des Nomadoss. With light, we chase away darkness; with the power of God, we chase away demons.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4155290/b90fd9a7f6e36b74e1e68c49c1083621206c3b67/header.jpg?t=1769184252", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4155290/4e742700363519558fe35e6128992662b8153802/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769184252", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4155290/4e742700363519558fe35e6128992662b8153802/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769184252", "website": "https://propheticgamesproductions.com/main/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia RTX 2070<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Please note that the game is still in development, performance issues may occur.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i9<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 32 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia RTX 3070<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Ad